-- REQUEST organizations/Organization: a QuotaAccount must exist for every organization; is_org_owner(organization, user) predicate.
-- REQUEST authentication/AuthSource.quota_group_claim_name: OAuth2 claim carrying the groups used for quota sync.
-- REQUEST authentication/AuthSource.quota_group_map: mapping source-group -> set of quota group names (validated JSON).
-- REQUEST authentication/AuthSource.quota_group_map_removal: Boolean, remove memberships for unclaimed mapped groups.
-- REQUEST repositories, code, releases, issues, wiki, pulls, packages, actions: guard each operation listed in the QuotaGate defaults with `requires: quota/quota_allows(<charged account>, <subject>)` (the contract stated by surface QuotaGateReference).
-- REQUEST repositories/Repository.git_size, lfs_size; issues/Attachment.size (+ whether it belongs to a release); actions/Artifact.compressed_size and status; packages/PackageBlob.size: the figures QuotaUsage is computed from.
-- REQUEST repositories (mirror scheduler): skip a scheduled pull-mirror sync, without error, while the owner's quota does not allow size_repos_all.
